$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrgs1sqflem2  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for dchrgs1sqf: if the trivial Gauss sums mod U and mod V have modulus 1 and U, V are coprime, so does the trivial Gauss sum mod ( U x. V ) (the CRT split of Lean norm_gaussSum_one_squarefree).

